<title>USA: National Media extends reach in Russia.</title>
<headline>National Media extends reach in Russia.</headline>
<dateline>PHILADELPHIA 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>National Media Corp on Thursday said its transactional television programming was now carried over a second network in Russia, boosting the number of households it reaches by 55 million.</p>
<p>The programming now reaches 67 million households in Russia and the neighboring countries of Belarus and Ukraine.</p>
<p>The company did not announce financial details of the expansion, which brought the programming to the RTR (TV2) network. Since early February, the programming had reached about 12 million households via TV6.</p>
<p>Officials at the company were not immediately available to comment further.</p>
</text>
